# .dockerignore for NatWest Fraud Detection .NET application

# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/packages/

# Visual Studio artifacts
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userprefs

# Documentation (not needed in container)
README.md
ARCHITECTURE.md

# Environment files (secrets must not be baked into image)
.env

# Test projects
**/*Tests*/
**/*Test*/

# NuGet packages (restored during build stage)
packages/
